usage:
For apps with many actions or pages. Trigger it with a button and with Cmd/Ctrl+K; selecting an item is the app’s job. On pages with multiple palettes, Cmd/Ctrl+K opens the palette associated with the focused trigger, or the first palette in document order if there is none.

```js
document.addEventListener('kata-command-select', event => {
  console.log(event.detail.item);
});
```
